language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

unit PlanningCoordinator.
capability CurrentBuckingAdvice.
functionality FreezePlanningInput.
functionality ScheduleOneBest.
functionality ScheduleQuietArchive.
functionality AcceptPlanningResult.
functionality PublishBuckingState.

BuckingService contains PlanningCoordinator.
PlanningCoordinator provides CurrentBuckingAdvice.
PlanningCoordinator status proposed.
PlanningCoordinator cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/Domains/DetailedArchitectureDiscussion.md".
PlanningCoordinator owns FreezePlanningInput.
FreezePlanningInput realizes CurrentBuckingAdvice.
FreezePlanningInput specifies "Capture Machine session/measurement, profile/model, APT, economic/policy and generation identity before work.".
PlanningCoordinator owns ScheduleOneBest.
ScheduleOneBest realizes CurrentBuckingAdvice.
ScheduleOneBest specifies "Run K1 independently of quiet K-best; worker results return to owner reducer rather than mutating shared authority.".
PlanningCoordinator owns ScheduleQuietArchive.
ScheduleQuietArchive realizes CurrentBuckingAdvice.
ScheduleQuietArchive specifies "Run/cancel background alternatives without starving current K1; preserve deterministic frozen-input semantics.".
PlanningCoordinator owns AcceptPlanningResult.
AcceptPlanningResult realizes CurrentBuckingAdvice.
AcceptPlanningResult specifies "Revalidate session/revision/generation; reject stale result; retain prior valid plan with pending/stale metadata.".
PlanningCoordinator owns PublishBuckingState.
PublishBuckingState realizes CurrentBuckingAdvice.
PublishBuckingState specifies "Multi-client Bucking state/events/snapshots/capabilities; retain cut-target identity independent of display cadence.".
